# ComfyUI Configuration
COMFY_PATH=/home/nikhil/Documents/Remo2/ComfyUI
COMFY_OUTPUT=/home/nikhil/Documents/Remo2/ComfyUI/output
COMFY_INPUT=/home/nikhil/Documents/Remo2/ComfyUI/input
